  "bio": "Vivek is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Worthing, United Kingdom, specializing in fine line, black and gray, and intricate floral designs. As a committed vegan, Vivek takes pride in offering 100% vegan-friendly tattooing options, ensuring that both the process and the products align with ethical standards. Clients can expect an artist who is not only talented but also maintains a clean and professional environment, leading the way in both artistry and conscientious practices.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Worthing, England, United Kingdom"
